    {
      "title": "Waterfall Nude",
      "slug": "624",
      "description": "<p>I've never photographed nudes, but it felt right to approach this waterfall\nscene with a boudoir sensibility. The texture contrast between rock and water\nfeels lacy and intimate. I'd normally chalk this up to going just a bit nutty\nafter extended time alone, but this was day one of my most recent photo trip.\nThe first photograph is usually the most difficult but this one arrived easily.</p>",
